宮内の様子\n・2対の細長い子宮を持ち、片方には逆レイプの時にショタから搾り取った精液が、もう片方にはショタ自身が入っている\n・精液の量はショタの体格と同じくらい\n・うさキュバスはお腹を少し膨らまして愛おしそうな様子\n・子宮の外見イメージや中の様子は参考資料を参照", "nc": 169, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@catfox22/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a7c6cb75/uploads/origins/f5d6ba36-bec8-4954-b91a-8b6b840a9b9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b49c6c7c4c089292e4568a34a2749a74", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a7c6cb75/uploads/origins/f5d6ba36-bec8-4954-b91a-8b6b840a9b9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b49c6c7c4c089292e4568a34a2749a74, https://si.imgix.net/a7c6cb75/uploads/origins/f5d6ba36-bec8-4954-b91a-8b6b840a9b9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=92cb6840539bb04b2d69bf5a5e07a210 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a7c6cb75/uploads/origins/f5d6ba36-bec8-4954-b91a-8b6b840a9b9f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e4731455512219711a9e084226b4328b 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1966092, "nc": 161}, {"path": "/@catfox22/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1966092, "client_id": 697831, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8a2bf27f/uploads/origins/f64bf6f7-9766-401b-a8f2-a24c6f5c911d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e670164920e5f6bf46b26a921847c094", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8a2bf27f/upl